'''Professor's Research''' (Japanese: '''博士の研究''' ''Doctor's Research'') is a {{TCG|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Promo-A}} series of cards.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Draw 2 cards.
}}

==Release information==
The promo print of Professor's Research cards were first made available to purchase from the in-game {{TCGP|shop}} on October 30, 2024 worldwide (September 26, 2024 in New Zealand) for 2 Shop Tickets each.

