==Trivia==
* This card's effect is identical to that of {{TCG|Bill}} and {{TCG|Mom's Kindness}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], which are both {{TCGP|Supporter}} cards.
** {{TCG|Professor's Research}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but with a different effect.

===Origin===
* This card features [[Professor Oak]], the resident [[Pokémon Professor]] of the [[Kanto]] region. The interior of [[Professor Oak's Laboratory|his laboratory]], as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, is featured in the promo illustration.

